  "review_notes": [
    "Four pricing fields remain unchanged because the inspected pages did not explicitly state a price model: MeshLab, Instant Meshes, F3D and Meshroom.",
    "Blender download and canonical repository HTTP requests were blocked with 403 in this environment. The official installation manual successfully retrieved and explicitly links the download page; repository enrichment is omitted rather than replaced by an unverified URL.",
    "ArmorPaint moved its active official source presentation to git.armorpaint.org. The project homepage, download page and current source repository were retrieved successfully.",
    "Wings3D homepage and redirected official downloads returned HTTP 200 during this source review; earlier transient server errors do not establish a dead site.",
    "Substance Painter Linux availability is edition-dependent; Adobe requirements and Adobe Steam listing were reviewed.",
    "OpenToonz Linux support is evidenced by the upstream README/build instructions, while the primary product page emphasizes Windows/macOS downloadable builds.",
    "A Windows/macOS/Linux label identifies documented availability, not an installation test, minimum hardware guarantee, or feature parity."
  ]
